  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and saute until translucent.",
    "Add the chopped bell pepper and scotch bonnet pepper and saute for another 2 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and saute for 1 minute.",
    "Add the sliced black pudding and cook until browned on both sides.",
    "Add the chopped thyme, ground allspice, and dry red wine, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the diced potatoes and stir to combine.",
    "Transfer the skillet to the oven and bake at 375 degrees Fahrenheit for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the skillet from the oven and use a spatula to fold the hash over on itself.",
    "Return the skillet to the oven and bake for an additional 10 minutes."
